{"version":2,"sourceHash":"8ba562241517e1e324fbb5326f4ec69210a15b0a6dae5c333b57fe04c2e0c36e","locale":"zh-CN","id":"ep-21a","no":"EP.21A","tag":"EP.21A · 想不起的名字","title":"想不起的名字","rev":2,"beats":[{"id":"ep-21a:1","s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi悄悄走出熟睡的房间。关门前，他回头看了一眼。Yeoni踢开被子，张着嘴睡着。","bg":"library2","tone":"dark","bgm":"neo2","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"library2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: library2","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"library2 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-21a:2","s":"neo","t":"盖好被子再睡。感冒了，又要怪客服吧。","x":"soft","l":null,"c":{"who":"neo","x":"soft"},"r":null},{"id":"ep-21a:3","s":"n","t":"他用前爪夹住被角，拉到Yeoni肩头。Yeoni翻了个身，把那只前爪当枕头，抱进怀里。"},{"id":"ep-21a:4","s":"neo","t":"放手。我不是枕头。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-21a:5","s":"n","t":"Yeoni没松开。Yeongnyangi就这样趴了许久，才极慢地抽出前爪，塞了一本书进去代替。"},{"id":"ep-21a:6","s":"neo","t":"抱歉。今天这本书代班客服。","x":"soft"},{"id":"ep-21a:7","s":"n","t":"没有回答。Yeoni只在梦里，含糊地说了一句，一星。Yeongnyangi轻轻笑了。"},{"id":"ep-21a:8","s":"n","t":"上楼时，他把肩膀靠在墙上。左爪又不听使唤了。","sfx":"thud"},{"id":"ep-21a:9","s":"n","t":"他抬起前爪。红锈沿着焦痕蔓延。落水之后，锈每天长出一指节。","im":true,"shot":"close","fx":"metal","scene":{"background":"library2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: library2","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"metal","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"library2 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-21a:10","s":"neo","t":"遇火烧焦，遇水生锈。金属也真难照顾。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:11","s":"n","t":"他用斗篷下摆盖住锈迹。明早也不能让Yeoni看见。虽然摩卡和闰月已经发现，不过那两人嘴很严。"},{"id":"ep-21a:12","s":"n","t":"不对，水獭不严。今天下午，那条尾巴，大概什么都说了。"},{"id":"ep-21a:13","s":"n","t":"雨的气味从楼梯窗飘进来。每次闻到，Yeongnyangi脑海里，就有什么咔嗒打开，又合上。","bgm":"memWater","scene":{"background":"library2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: library2","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"library2 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-21a:14","s":"n","t":"雨中的车站。雨水从旧屋檐下，连成线落下。","bg":"rainStop","tone":"desat","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"rainStop","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: rainStop","transition":"crossfade","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"rainStop 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-21a:15","s":"n","t":"某个人的手，握着伞。是一只小手。伞倾斜一半，朝向身旁的人。"},{"id":"ep-21a:16","s":"n","t":"伞下，有人笑着。淋着雨，傻乎乎的，却无比开心。","im":true,"shot":"close","sfx":"rain","scene":{"background":"rainStop","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: rainStop","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"rainStop 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-21a:17","s":"n","t":"一起撑吧。记忆里，有人这样说。Yeongnyangi想抓住那个声音，可手里抓到的，只有雨水。"},{"id":"ep-21a:18","s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi把额头抵在冰冷的墙上。记忆总到这里为止。握伞的手。那是谁的手，旁边又站着谁。","bg":"library2","tone":"dark","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"library2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: library2","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"library2 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-21a:19","s":"neo","t":"要是知道名字就好了。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-21a:20","s":"sys","t":"[ 契约第一条 · 守护者不得说出自己的名字 · 名字被唤出的瞬间，契约即告终结 ]","im":true,"fx":"script","sfx":"glitch","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"library2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: library2","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"script","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"library2 배경에서 진행되는 시스템 메시지"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-21a:21","s":"n","t":"金色文字在眼前浮现，又消失。那是客服的规则。也是当初接下这份工作时，他亲手签下的规则。"},{"id":"ep-21a:22","s":"neo","t":"我知道。从来没忘。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:23","s":"n","t":"他忘了自己的名字。却没有忘记，舍弃那个名字，是为了换来什么。"},{"id":"ep-21a:24","s":"neo","t":"再一次就好。这一次，一直陪在身边，到最后。","x":"soft"},{"id":"ep-21a:25","s":"n","t":"他看着楼梯窗映出的自己。深蓝帽子，泛着金光的紫眼睛，生锈的前爪。那是戴帽子的猫的脸。"},{"id":"ep-21a:26","s":"neo","t":"第一次用这张脸睁开眼，她看着我，问我是不是普通的猫。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:27","s":"n","t":"然后，她打了分。一星。Yeongnyangi至今仍清楚记得，那天收到的一星。明明连自己的名字都想不起来。"},{"id":"ep-21a:28","s":"n","t":"屋顶上，风很大。被吞去一半的太阳，挂在夜空。那是既非白昼，也非黑夜的天空。","bg":"eclipseSky","tone":"dark","bgm":"stillLake","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-21a:29","s":"n","t":"屋顶尽头，坐着黑虎。仿佛从一开始，就在等他。"},{"id":"ep-21a:30","s":"tiger","t":"来晚了，猫。","x":"base","l":{"who":"neo","x":"serious"},"c":null,"r":{"who":"tiger","x":"base"}},{"id":"ep-21a:31","s":"neo","t":"闻到雨味，就来看看。这次又想偷谁的书。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:32","s":"tiger","t":"今天不是来工作的。有话对你说。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-21a:33","s":"neo","t":"对猪说话不客气，对我也不客气。你会对谁恭恭敬敬呢。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-21a:34","s":"tiger","t":"别问没用的问题。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-21a:35","s":"neo","t":"对账簿的主人吗。对那个声音。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-21a:36","s":"tiger","t":"闭嘴。那个声音，现在也在听。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-21a:37","s":"n","t":"老虎瞥了一眼天空。半轮太阳的黑色一侧，极缓慢地蠕动着。"},{"id":"ep-21a:38","s":"n","t":"老虎的红眼，落到Yeongnyangi的左爪上。准确地找到了，斗篷下摆盖住的锈迹。"},{"id":"ep-21a:39","s":"tiger","t":"那只爪子。每天蔓延一指节，对吧。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-21a:40","s":"neo","t":"你怎么知道。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:41","s":"tiger","t":"账簿上全记着。每次你在那孩子身边受伤，她那一栏，就有一行变得更重。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-21a:42","s":"neo","t":"别动她那一栏。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-21a:43","s":"tiger","t":"动的不是我。是你。她的火越大，你越会熔化。你越硬撑，她就越渺小。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-21a:44","s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi没回答。两人都知道，他无话反驳。","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-21a:45","s":"tiger","t":"离开吧。现在走，她还能靠七格活下去。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-21a:46","s":"neo","t":"七格，会变成容器。你也知道吧。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:47","s":"tiger","t":"你，怎么知道那个。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-21a:48","s":"neo","t":"就算看不了账簿，我也会看天。被吞掉的太阳想要什么，我还是看得出来。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:49","s":"n","t":"雨滴开始落在两人之间。明明天很晴，只有他们站着的地方下起了雨。","sfx":"rain"},{"id":"ep-21a:50","s":"neo","t":"不过，你的雨味，我好像以前闻过。","x":"soft"},{"id":"ep-21a:51","s":"tiger","t":"错觉。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-21a:52","s":"neo","t":"雨伞。车站。一起撑吧，那句话。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:53","s":"n","t":"老虎的尾巴重重拍在地上。雨水飞溅。","im":true,"fx":"water","sfx":"thud","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"water","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-21a:54","s":"tiger","t":"别说那个。你没资格谈那个春天。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-21a:55","s":"neo","t":"那就没错了。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:56","s":"neo","t":"我们来自同一个春天。","x":"serious","bgm":"crisis2","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 neo의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-21a:57","s":"n","t":"老虎没回答，却抬起前爪，紧紧握住颈上的金环。明明金环什么也没做。"},{"id":"ep-21a:58","s":"tiger","t":"想不起来，就别装知道。那最残忍。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-21a:59","s":"neo","t":"我想不起来。所以才问。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-21a:60","s":"tiger","t":"我全都记得。一点不漏。所以，才会这样活着。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-21a:61","s":"neo","t":"那个春天，发生了什么。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:62","s":"tiger","t":"你说要保护的人，消失了。就这样。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-21a:63","s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi的前爪一颤。生锈的地方，突然灼痛起来。记忆还没回来，身体已经先痛了。","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-21a:64","s":"neo","t":"原来如此。难怪这一次，我接下了这份工作。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-21a:65","s":"tiger","t":"这次，也会一样结束。你又迟到，我又独自留下。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-21a:66","s":"tiger","t":"别问了。我凭什么回答一只连名字都不知道的猫。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-21a:67","s":"neo","t":"彼此彼此。我也不知道你的名字。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-21a:68","s":"n","t":"风吹过。Yeongnyangi眼眸深处，金光骤起，又消失。那道光，连他自己也没察觉。","im":true,"fx":"veil","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"veil","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-21a:69","s":"tiger","t":"你刚才的眼睛。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-21a:70","s":"neo","t":"别在意。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:71","s":"tiger","t":"在空格前，也是那双眼睛。你自己也不知道，还是装不知道。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-21a:72","s":"neo","t":"客服不回答私人问题。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-21a:73","s":"n","t":"这时，下方传来开窗声。极其小心，却又像猪会做的那样，还是有点吵。"},{"id":"ep-21a:74","s":"n","t":"白猫与黑虎同时转头。窗框上，挂着一只粉红色前蹄。","im":true,"shot":"impact","sfx":"door","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}}]}
